  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Reproducible by construction",
      "items": [
        "agenv.lock pins every skill to a full commit plus a sha256 of its tree",
        "A checksum mismatch aborts before the installed tree is touched",
        "A frozen entry installs from the store without touching the network; only update re-resolves",
        "agenv status reports drift — added, removed, ref-changed, checksum-mismatch — and exits non-zero"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Shared, content-addressed store",
      "items": [
        "The store is keyed by sha256(source): one bare clone per source, one detached worktree per commit",
        "It is shared across projects, so a second project reuses an already fetched commit",
        "agenv store prune drops the entries the current lock no longer references"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "One manifest, one portable layout",
      "items": [
        "The manifest is a flat [skills] table; the earlier harness field and harness command are gone",
        "Every skill lands in .agents/skills/<name>, written through a temp dir plus rename and refusing symlinked paths",
        "A skill in skills/<name> with a relative source stays out of the lock; sync adopts on-disk skills and sync --prune deletes undeclared ones"
      ]
    }
  ]
